      "mergedPostDetails": "Open VRChat, press the R key to open the radial menu, select an expression, some users are unable to send official emoji expressions.\n\nSince April, it has been impossible to send official emoji on Roulette.I have tried changing the game version and verifying the game integrity, but neither could solve this bug, and I also encountered more players who have the same problem as me.\n\nThis is a video about feedback.\n\nhttps://b23.tv/TNrbseu\n\nIt is still unclear whether this bug is related to the computer configuration, so I have decided to provide you with my computer configuration.\n\nMOBO:GIGABYTE h410m S2 V3\n\nCPU:i5 10400f\n\nGPU:AMD rx6600 8GB\n\nRMA:Knigston 2666Hz 8GB *2\n\nHard Disk:WDC WD10EZEX-00BBHA0(932GB) & GIGABYTE GP-GSTFS31240GNTD(224GB)",
