  "details": "My emojis do not spawn at all in VRChat.\n\nI tried the following steps but the issue persists:\n\n- Full reinstall of VRChat\n\n- Clearing cache\n\n- Resetting settings\n\n- Checking Safety settings\n\n- Trying different worlds\n\n- Trying different devices\n\nOther users can spawn emojis normally, so this issue seems to be tied to my account specifically.\n\nAdditional information:\n\nOne of my friends is also experiencing the same issue where emojis do not spawn.  \n\nI have also seen several other users on Twitter reporting the same problem.  \n\nThis suggests that the issue may not be limited to my environment.\n\nPlease investigate this issue. Thank you.",
